@host = http://127.0.0.1:5088

### Liveness
GET {{host}}/health/live

### Dependency check: local writable directory
GET {{host}}/health/dependencies

### Generate a correlation ID
GET {{host}}/api/demo/trace

### Preserve a valid correlation ID
GET {{host}}/api/demo/trace
X-Correlation-ID: classroom-demo-123

### Do not log private input content
POST {{host}}/api/demo/submit?password=SECRET_QUERY_DO_NOT_LOG
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: demo-submit-123

{
  "note": "SECRET_BODY_DO_NOT_LOG"
}

### Return sanitized HTTP 500 (Development only)
GET {{host}}/api/demo/fail
X-Correlation-ID: classroom-fail-123
